Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.61,0:00:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,ln closing, l can tell you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.32,0:00:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,we take this very seriously.\NAPD as well as the DEA.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.82,0:00:12.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Stopping the manufacture\Nand sale of methamphetamines
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.20,0:00:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,remains one of\Nour highest priorities.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.37,0:00:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,And the theft of lab equipment\Nfrom your school is also\Nreceiving our highest attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.54,0:00:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Rest assured,\Nno stone will go unturned
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.63,0:00:24.72,Default,,0,0,0,,in our search for the person\Nor persons responsible for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.88,0:00:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,lf you have any questions,\Nnow would be the time. Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.93,0:00:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,MAN 1 :\NYou're talking like you\Nhaven't caught anybody yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.26,0:00:33.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What about the janitor\Nthat was dealing drugs\Nat the school?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.72,0:00:37.39,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no indication\Nthat this individual was\Nselling drugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.56,0:00:40.31,Default,,0,0,0,,He was arrested for having\Na small amount of marijuana
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.48,0:00:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,in his car,\Nnot in the school.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.07,0:00:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,And he's since\Nbeen fired.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.98,0:00:46.61,Default,,0,0,0,,MAN 1 :\Nl heard he had a record.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.78,0:00:48.99,Default,,0,0,0,,l'd like to know how he got\Na job here in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.15,0:00:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly. Why wasn't there\Na background check?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.99,0:00:55.41,Default,,0,0,0,,CARMEN:\NThere was one. We're currently\Nreviewing our hiring policies.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.58,0:00:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,WOMAN 1 : You better be\Ndoing more than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.25,0:00:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy was arrested\Nright in front of my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.25,0:01:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,MAN 1 :\NThis guy was stealing\Nlab equipment, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.50,0:01:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,MAN 2:\NThat's not our thinking this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.75,0:01:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We're looking at others who\Nalso had access, but not limited\Nto the maintenance staff.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.17,0:01:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,WOMAN 2:\NAre you saying\Nthere was a break-in?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.01,0:01:10.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Do we know exactly\Nwhen this happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.59,0:01:13.09,Default,,0,0,0,,l mean, could it have been\Nduring school hours?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.26,0:01:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We haven't been able to\Nestablish a date or time.\NBut there is no sign
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.77,0:01:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,of breaking or entering.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.27,0:01:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,MAN 1 :\NSo whoever took it had a key.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.77,0:01:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,We're talking inside job?\NSomeone who's still at the school?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.27,0:01:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,MAN 2: Sir, at this time\Nl'm not able to discuss\Nthe details with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.11,0:01:31.11,Default,,0,0,0,,But what l can tell you is that we\Nhave some very good people\Nworking very hard on this case.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.28,0:01:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,MAN 1 : l'm sorry, officer,\Nbut that just sounds like\Ndouble talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.45,0:01:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,WOMAN 2: We're trying\Nto protect our children.\NYou have to level with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.20,0:01:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,CARMEN:\NReally, we're giving you\Nall the information we have.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.50,0:01:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,MAN 1 : You know what l'd\Nlike to see in this school?\NDrug-sniffing dogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.54,0:01:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,WOMAN 2:\NYeah. Dogs and metal detectors and\Nlocker searches and strip-searches.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.63,0:01:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,CARMEN:\NOur district has strict policies--
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.80,0:01:51.47,Default,,0,0,0,,WOMAN 3: l heard about\Nthis school up in Canada,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.63,0:01:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,they arrested one of the\Ngroundskeepers with drugs,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.47,0:01:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,and the next day they\Nfound out over half of the\Nstudents were high on LSD.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.31,0:02:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,WOMAN 2:\NLSD? When were you\Ngonna tell us about the LSD?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.18,0:02:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,CARMEN:\NNo, please. No one said\Nanything about LSD.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.69,0:02:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,[♪♪♪]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.32,0:02:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,MAN 1 :\NWhat about the\Nequipment that was stolen?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.36,0:02:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,CARMEN:\NThe equipment was taken from\Nour chemistry-department locker.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.03,0:02:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,And tonight we're lucky\Nenough to have someone here\Nto give us some specifics.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.75,0:02:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Walt?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.00,0:02:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.33,0:02:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. White is currently\Non medical leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.67,0:02:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,But as he's chair\Nof the science department,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.01,0:02:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,he's made a very special\Neffort to be with us here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.34,0:02:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,And l'd like to take a moment\Nto thank him for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.90,0:02:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you please tell us\Nmore about the equipment\Nthat was taken?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.40,0:02:52.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.\NWALT: Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.99,0:02:54.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.70,0:02:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,And thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.08,0:03:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,[CLEARS THROAT]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.00,0:03:05.09,Default,,0,0,0,,The inventory list for the\Nmissing lab-wear is as follows:
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.29,0:03:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,One 5000 milliliter\Nround-bottom boiling flask.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.63,0:03:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,One Kjeldahl-style recovery flask,\N800 milliliters.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.43,0:03:18.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Two full-face respirators.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.51,0:03:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Some CEP funnels, some head\Nwith a thermometer holder.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.56,0:03:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,[MOANlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.73,0:03:31.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh. Ow. Okay.\NOkay. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.57,0:03:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.74,0:03:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did that come from?\NAnd why was it so damn good?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.62,0:03:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Because it was illegal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.75,0:03:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,[♪♪♪]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.11,0:04:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,,[DOOR OPENS]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.45,0:04:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,The basement.\NUnfinished, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.46,0:04:28.29,Default,,0,0,0,,But just look\Nat all this space.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.46,0:04:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta think rec room,\Nmedia room.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.84,0:04:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Just imagine all the things\Nyou could do down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.84,0:04:38.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Now remember,\Nyou're buying for this\Nfantastic neighborhood.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.68,0:04:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Big lawns\Nand shade trees,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.89,0:04:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,walking distance to\Nthe country club.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.06,0:04:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened there?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.94,0:04:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Bit of a fixer, but this\Nhouse has great bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.66,0:05:02.99,Default,,0,0,0,,REALTOR:\NKnow what? We're zeroing in.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.16,0:05:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,l've got another listing, brand-new,\Nright around the corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.70,0:05:06.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah?\NYeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.12,0:05:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi.\NHi.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.75,0:05:11.79,Default,,0,0,0,,lt's by appointment only.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.96,0:05:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, well, l'm here\Nto see the owner.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.46,0:05:20.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh. He's in the, uh,\Nrecreational vehicle.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.09,0:05:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,[CAR ENGlNE STARTS]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.56,0:05:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,JESSE:\NYo, it's appointment only.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.99,0:05:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,How are you feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.45,0:05:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,About as good\Nas you look.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.79,0:05:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Jeez, you look like Lex Luthor.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.50,0:05:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, l visited\Nyou in the hospital,\Nbut you were asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.71,0:05:58.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Skinny Pete said\Nyou wanted Tuco's address.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.09,0:06:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Acting like you're\Nall out for blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.93,0:06:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,But you are alive.\NObviously you wised up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.97,0:06:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,No, l did go see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.72,0:06:08.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.14,0:06:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what, are you\Nselling your house?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.06,0:06:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,l got two dudes that turned\Ninto raspberry slushy\Nand flushed down my toilet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.06,0:06:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,l can't even take\Na proper dump in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.61,0:06:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,l mean, the whole damn house\Nhas gotta be haunted by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.78,0:06:24.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't actually go see Tuco.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.74,0:06:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.91,0:06:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,That is 1 7,500.\NYour half of the 35,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.50,0:06:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Plus, there's an extra 1 5 in there.\Nlt's all yours. You've earned it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.13,0:06:41.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You got this money from Tuco?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.30,0:06:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.\NSo Tuco gave you this,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.43,0:06:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,is what you're saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.93,0:06:45.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, we made a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.14,0:06:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You made a deal?\NThat's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.60,0:06:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,How--? Why would you make\Na deal with that scumbag?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.10,0:06:54.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You see what he did\Nto me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.60,0:06:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Because l think that we\Ncan do business together.\NWe came to an understanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.44,0:07:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,No way, man.\NOkay? No understanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.94,0:07:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a look\Nat the money in your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.11,0:07:07.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, just imagine\Nmaking that every week.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.91,0:07:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right. Two pounds a week,\N35,000 a pound.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.70,0:07:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Without even talking to me\Nyou told this insane ass-clown
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.00,0:07:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,dead-eyed killer that, uh--
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.55,0:07:24.47,Default,,0,0,0,,That we would\Ngive him 2 pounds a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.63,0:07:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll just scale up our operation,\Nwe'll add a few more hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.47,0:07:29.14,Default,,0,0,0,,No, don't talk to me about hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.30,0:07:32.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What about pseudo, man?\NHow are we gonna get that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.72,0:07:36.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You think the meth fairy's\Njust gonna bring it to us?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.69,0:07:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,God, it takes me a week\Nto get this stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.31,0:07:41.35,Default,,0,0,0,,l'm driving all the way\Nout to Las Cruces,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.57,0:07:44.57,Default,,0,0,0,,200 miles each way\Nto meet up with my smurfs.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.82,0:07:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Smurfs?\NThe dudes who go to the drugstores
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.95,0:07:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,and get a couple boxes at a time\Nand then sell them to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.03,0:07:53.95,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's maybe only good for,\Nlike, maybe a half-pound worth.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.16,0:07:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,See, that's the bottleneck\Nin your brilliant business plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.33,0:07:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.58,0:08:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, you would've known\Nthat if you would've just asked me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.84,0:08:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,DELCAVOLl:\NWell, here we are again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.84,0:08:08.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.72,0:08:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Skyler, you look great.\NThank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.55,0:08:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You must be, what,\Nsix, seven months?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.47,0:08:15.85,Default,,0,0,0,,How goes it?\Nlt's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.02,0:08:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, other than waddling to\Nthe bathroom every five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.06,0:08:20.69,Default,,0,0,0,,[BOTH CHUCKLE]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.86,0:08:22.61,Default,,0,0,0,,The baby shower\Nis next week.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.77,0:08:24.85,Default,,0,0,0,,And it'll be good to. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.03,0:08:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,lt'll be good to have a day\Nthat's just about Skyler.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.86,0:08:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Very nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.91,0:08:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.\NThank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.37,0:08:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Walt, l see you've\Ncommitted to the hair loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.37,0:08:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.37,0:08:39.71,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you feel?\NAh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.08,0:08:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,l-- You know,\Npretty decent, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.50,0:08:46.71,Default,,0,0,0,,His color is better.\NYou know, his energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.92,0:08:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,And he's even more, um, physical.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.64,0:08:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,More physical?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.31,0:08:55.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, well, sexual.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.06,0:08:57.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.60,0:09:02.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Frisky, actually.\Nl mean, that's gotta be\Na good sign, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.90,0:09:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, l'll take that. Right, Walt?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.07,0:09:06.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.28,0:09:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Couldn't that mean that\Nthe chemo is working?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.82,0:09:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, realistically, it may\Njust mean that we've got\Nthe antiemetics tuned right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.07,0:09:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Truth is, until Walt's\Nfinished this round of chemo\Nand we look at a new PET scan,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.41,0:09:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,we just can't say\Nfor sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.62,0:09:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,SKYLER:\NWell, isn't there anything else\Nwe could be doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.13,0:09:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,l've been wondering\Nabout alternative medicine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.67,0:09:29.09,Default,,0,0,0,,l mean, Eastern healing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.26,0:09:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, holistic.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.34,0:09:33.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, l can't speak to its efficacy,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.64,0:09:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,but as long as it doesn't\Ninterfere with our treatment,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.77,0:09:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,,anything that helps my patient\Nhave a better outlook,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.81,0:09:43.61,Default,,0,0,0,,a better comfort, is fine by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.77,0:09:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're saying\Nit's just all psychological.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.19,0:09:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,lt doesn't make any\Nreal difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.65,0:09:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Having a better outlook can\Nmake a tremendous difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.45,0:09:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's also important that\Nwe manage our expectations.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.08,0:10:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,[♪♪♪]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.81,0:10:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.81,0:10:29.61,Default,,0,0,0,,A junkyard? Let me guess,\Nyou picked this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.53,0:10:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with it?\Nlt's private.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.70,0:10:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,This is like a non-criminal's\Nidea of a drug meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.33,0:10:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,This is like, "Oh, l saw this\Nin a movie. Ooh, look at me."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.16,0:10:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. So where do you\Ntransact your business?\NEnlighten me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.17,0:10:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,l don't know,\Nhow about Taco Cabeza?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.13,0:10:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Half the deals l've ever done\Nwent down at Taco Cabeza.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.21,0:10:55.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice and public.\NOpen 24 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.84,0:10:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody ever gets shot\Nat Taco Cabeza.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.43,0:11:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hell, why not\Nthe mall?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.73,0:11:06.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, wait at the Gap.\N"Hey, it's time for the meet."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.23,0:11:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, l'll put down\Nthe flat-front khakis,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.19,0:11:11.53,Default,,0,0,0,,head on over,\Ngrab an Orange Julius.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.69,0:11:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Skip the part where\Npsycho-lunatic Tuco,\Nyou know,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.45,0:11:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,comes and steals my\Ndrugs and leaves me\Nbleeding to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.53,0:11:22.07,Default,,0,0,0,,[HURRlCANE CHRlS'\N"THE HAND CLAP"\NPLAYlNG ON CAR STEREO]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.38,0:11:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, you don't have\Nto be here for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.38,0:11:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay? l mean,\Nseriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.42,0:11:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,,l'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.55,0:11:40.43,Default,,0,0,0,,No. l'm no pussy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.06,0:11:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,l'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.94,0:11:49.19,Default,,0,0,0,,[MUSlC STOPS]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.95,0:12:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Clean and his boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.08,0:12:03.71,Default,,0,0,0,,[TUCO CHUCKLES]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.91,0:12:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, l'm sorry\Nthat l had to tune you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.25,0:12:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Respect, ése,\Nyou gotta give it to get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.09,0:12:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.13,0:12:15.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what are we doing\Nway the hell out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.80,0:12:18.59,Default,,0,0,0,,What, they close the mall\Nor something?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.30,0:12:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Heisenberg, come on,\Nbreak it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.98,0:12:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it? That's all you got?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.60,0:12:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,We had some\Nproduction problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.94,0:12:33.11,Default,,0,0,0,,0.53.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.11,0:12:35.53,Default,,0,0,0,,l thought you was\Na player.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.24,0:12:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You told me\N2 pounds,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.82,0:12:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,and now you waste my time\Nwith these Chiclets?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.67,0:12:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Seventeen and a half.\NMinus the half for\Nwasting my time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.84,0:13:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,WALT: Hey, come on.\NWhat, you gonna argue?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.47,0:13:02.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You got something to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.27,0:13:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You're doing business\Nlike a couple little bitches.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.19,0:13:11.15,Default,,0,0,0,,l want all of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.15,0:13:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Seventy grand.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.82,0:13:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.15,0:13:18.65,Default,,0,0,0,,WALT:\NYou like this product.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.15,0:13:20.69,Default,,0,0,0,,And you want more.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.86,0:13:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Consider it a capital investment.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.20,0:13:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, old, bald motherfucker.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.04,0:13:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Fifty-two and a half,\N25 points vig.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.38,0:13:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Vig?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.38,0:13:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,lnterest, weekly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.93,0:13:45.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.01,0:13:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That's $65,625\Nwith interest.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.44,0:13:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,1 .875 pounds.\NTUCO: No, 2 pounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.52,0:13:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Next Friday,\Nand no production problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.07,0:14:03.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you handle 4 pounds?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.95,0:14:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, old man, talk is talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.54,0:14:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,But owing me money,\Nthat's bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.56,0:14:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,[ENGlNE STARTS]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.65,0:14:37.07,Default,,0,0,0,,[TRUCK DRlVES OFF]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.23,0:14:41.73,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you just do?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.32,0:14:50.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Four pounds. Four pounds.\NTwo pounds wasn't bad enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.58,0:14:54.67,Default,,0,0,0,,We're talking 2, 300 boxes\Nof sinus pills.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.83,0:14:56.83,Default,,0,0,0,,There ain't that many\Nsmurfs in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.00,0:14:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not going to need\Npseudoephedrine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.17,0:15:02.05,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna make phenylacetone\Nin a tube furnace.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.22,0:15:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we're gonna use\Nreductive amination to yield\Nmethamphetamine, 4 pounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.72,0:15:09.43,Default,,0,0,0,,So no pseudo?\NNo pseudo.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.60,0:15:11.39,Default,,0,0,0,,So you do have a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.56,0:15:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Mr. White.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.02,0:15:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, science.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.27,0:15:17.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.28,0:15:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?\NThat is a shopping list.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.15,0:15:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, getting some of those\Nitems may be challenging.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.95,0:15:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,One autotransformer,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.99,0:15:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Six liters anhydrous\Nmethenamine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.79,0:15:39.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Two 35 M and M tube furnaces.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.79,0:15:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,lt's mm, millimeter.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.17,0:15:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,One 70 millimeter would be fine,\Nbut they're hard to come by, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.51,0:15:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Forty grams thorium nitrate.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.97,0:15:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo, Mr. White, l can't even\Npronounce half this shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.89,0:15:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,No. You know what?\NCount me out. All right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.76,0:15:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,l'm leaving town.\Nl'm moving to, like,\NOregon or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.48,0:15:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,This is just--\NJesse, Jesse, Jesse. Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.27,0:16:01.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Today is the first day\Nof the rest of your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.69,0:16:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.03,0:16:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the first day of the\Nrest of your life. But what\Nkind of life will it be, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.57,0:16:11.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Will it be a life of fear,\Nof "Oh, no, no, no.\Nl can't do this."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.66,0:16:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Of never once\Nbelieving in yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.70,0:16:16.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm?\Nl don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.00,0:16:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen. These things?\NWe need them, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.54,0:16:24.25,Default,,0,0,0,,And only you can\Nget them for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.34,0:16:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,[SlGHS]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.05,0:16:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,WALT JR. :\NOkay, it's ready. Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.39,0:16:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi, baby.\NI'm your Aunt Marie.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.27,0:16:42.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, of course you already\Nknow that because when\Nyou watch this,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.48,0:16:45.69,Default,,0,0,0,,20 years from now, l will look\Nexactly the same as l do now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.86,0:16:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I know, it is amazing. l have\Naged shockingly well. Haven't l?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.62,0:16:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, welcome to your\Nbaby shower, Esmeralda.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.21,0:16:58.71,Default,,0,0,0,,WALT JR. :\NEsmeralda?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.87,0:17:02.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Esmeralda. That's your name\Nand you heard it here first.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.59,0:17:07.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, that is your wonderful,\Nhandsome older brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.22,0:17:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Show her, older brother,\Nyour face.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.30,0:17:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, not right up the nose. Don't--\NOkay, not up it. Back. Back to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.60,0:17:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's your mommy.\NHello, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.60,0:17:22.89,Default,,0,0,0,,And look, there you are,\NEsmeralda.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.06,0:17:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,SKYLER:\NYeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.23,0:17:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, baby.\NTime to party.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.03,0:17:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. Easy, easy.\NBelieve it or not,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.82,0:17:35.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Esmeralda, right after the party,\Nyour name was changed to Holly.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.12,0:17:38.41,Default,,0,0,0,,And l believe, Hank, that\Nthat was around the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.58,0:17:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,that we took Aunt Marie\Nto the insane asylum.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.79,0:17:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah.\Nl dropped her off at the curb.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.25,0:17:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Then l married Shania Twain\Nand lived happily ever after.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.42,0:17:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,MARlE:\NHa, ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.46,0:17:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,There's Daddy. Speak, Daddy.\NSay hello to your daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.81,0:17:57.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.69,0:18:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Holly, l am very proud of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.86,0:18:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,And l... l think about you\Nall the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.78,0:18:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,ALL:\NAww.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.20,0:18:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Wherever you go,\Nwhatever you do in life,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.62,0:18:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,always know that you have a family\Nwho loves you very, very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.21,0:18:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheers.\NALL: Cheers.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.96,0:18:33.63,Default,,0,0,0,,SKYLER:\NOh, my God, it's so cute.\NOh, Carmen. lt's--
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.80,0:18:37.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, look. Look at that.\Nlt's adorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.31,0:18:40.69,Default,,0,0,0,,l love it, Carmen. Thank you.\NYou're so welcome, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.85,0:18:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,SKYLER:\NThank you.\NLook at the little feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.81,0:18:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. Oh.\NFrom me. And Hank.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.74,0:18:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh. What nice\Nwrapping paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.32,0:18:55.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Marie always finds\Nthe best wrapping paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.66,0:18:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,l do.\NOkay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.66,0:19:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see. And...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.83,0:19:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Exciting.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.33,0:19:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, boy, oh, boy, oh, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.01,0:19:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,lt's-- lt's a--
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.55,0:19:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,A tiara.\NYes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.05,0:19:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow! Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.18,0:19:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Marie, is this--?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.64,0:19:26.43,Default,,0,0,0,,White gold and several\Ncarats worth of zircons.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.65,0:19:29.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Marie.\NYou spent too much on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.27,0:19:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't have.\NYou really, really shouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.69,0:19:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's so--\Nlt's really-- lt's. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.86,0:19:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,lt's sparkly.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.24,0:19:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Sparkly.\Nl know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.45,0:19:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,,SKYLER:\NThank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.70,0:19:44.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, listen, Walt.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.54,0:19:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You got anything\Nstronger than beer?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.54,0:19:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,SKYLER: lt's-- lt's great. l love it.\NYeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.54,0:19:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you. Thank you,\Nsweetie, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.09,0:19:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,HANK:\NSorry, man. lt's just, you know, after\N200 presents, it just gets kind of old.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.05,0:19:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,[WALT LAUGHS]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.22,0:20:04.93,Default,,0,0,0,,lt's nice stuff.\Nlt is, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.60,0:20:11.48,Default,,0,0,0,,l got just the thing\Nto go with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.70,0:20:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,l'm sorry, man, l wasn't thinking.\NNo, no, no. lt's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.57,0:20:22.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You mind if l have one?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.95,0:20:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You think that's a good idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.91,0:20:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Hank, l've already got lung cancer.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.62,0:20:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.\NYou got me there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.80,0:20:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.63,0:20:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,[CLEARS THROAT]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.01,0:20:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Cuban.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.14,0:20:41.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.60,0:20:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,l did a little favor for an FBl guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.77,0:20:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, l was under\Nthe impression, ahem,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.11,0:20:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,that these were illegal.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.53,0:21:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, sometimes\Nforbidden fruit tastes\Nthe sweetest, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.79,0:21:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,lt's funny, isn't it?\NHow we draw that line.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.00,0:21:12.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.79,0:21:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What line is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.05,0:21:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, what's legal, what's illegal.\NYou know, Cuban cigars, alcohol.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.97,0:21:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, if we were drinking this\Nin 1 930, we'd be breaking the law.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.85,0:21:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Another year, we'd be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.27,0:21:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm. Who knows what\Nwill be legal next year.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.82,0:21:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean like pot?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.99,0:21:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Like pot.\NOr whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.00,0:21:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Cocaine? Heroin?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.71,0:21:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,l'm just saying it's arbitrary.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.51,0:21:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you ought to visit lockup.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.51,0:22:01.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You hear a lot of guys\Ntalking like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.09,0:22:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,"Hey, man, what, you busting me\Nwith these 1 4 bales of ganja?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.93,0:22:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,lt's all gonna be legal next year\Nwhen Willie Nelson's president."
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.73,0:22:12.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Say it, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.35,0:22:14.39,Default,,0,0,0,,lt don't only go one way either.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.56,0:22:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,l mean, some other stuff\Nis legal that shouldn't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.11,0:22:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,l mean, frigging meth\Nused to be legal.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.57,0:22:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Used to sell it over\Nevery counter at every\Npharmacy across America.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.12,0:22:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank God they came to\Ntheir senses on that one, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.71,0:22:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.92,0:22:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.14,0:22:47.39,Default,,0,0,0,,[GROANS]
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.56,0:22:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice party.\NMmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.89,0:22:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,,A tiara.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.48,0:23:00.15,Default,,0,0,0,,A white-gold tiara\Nfor a newborn baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.36,0:23:05.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. You know, l think\Nshe got that at Gertrude\NZachary's in Knob Hill.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.74,0:23:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,l mean, that thing must've cost,\Nlike, what, 5 or 600 dollars.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.50,0:23:17.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, l think\Nl'm gonna return it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.29,0:23:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?\NShe's bound to find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.09,0:23:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, maybe l can explain to her\Nthat we need a Diaper Genie
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.38,0:23:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,more than a white-gold\Nbaby tiara.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.60,0:23:33.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey. You know,\Nl've been thinking
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.52,0:23:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,about what you said\Nto Dr. Delcavoli about\Nalternative medicine.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.02,0:23:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,No. Don't worry. l'm not\Ngonna mention that anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.69,0:23:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, no. What l mean\Nis that maybe there is\Nsomething to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.40,0:23:51.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Look. They do this\NNavajo sweat lodge\Nup by Farmington.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.12,0:23:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Healing ceremony.\Nlt's supposed to be\Ngood for your lungs.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.17,0:23:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,,l'm not saying that\Nl believe in it, but, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.71,0:24:03.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it might be an experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.42,0:24:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.30,0:24:07.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.22,0:24:09.51,Default,,0,0,0,,ln a sweat lodge.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.68,0:24:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, l was thinking about driving up\Non Friday, coming back Sunday.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.97,0:24:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,,l mean, if you're okay with it.\NWell, of course l'm okay with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.15,0:24:19.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.86,0:24:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Sweat lodge?\NYeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.95,0:24:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,l'm already sweating.\NHelp me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.33,0:24:36.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. Ow.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.54,0:24:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.75,0:24:43.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Seventy millimeter tube furnace.\NExcellent. This is excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.84,0:24:45.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Very good work.\NDamn straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.17,0:24:48.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, hydrogen.\NElectrolytically\Nproduced, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.34,0:24:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, like you asked.\Nl mean, this--
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.39,0:24:53.93,Default,,0,0,0,,This crap wasn't easy to get.\NAnd it's expensive.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.10,0:24:55.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Methylamine.\NWhere's the methylamine?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.06,0:24:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,l don't see the methylamine.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.98,0:25:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, that's where\Nl ran into some trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.06,0:25:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of trouble?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.69,0:25:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, half this crap\Nl could just buy, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.03,0:25:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,But this methylamine. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.57,0:25:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Not so easy. l mean,\Nthey got it locked down tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.99,0:25:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,But l did find some pros\Nwho will rip it off for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.37,0:25:19.21,Default,,0,0,0,,But they want 1 0 grand.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.37,0:25:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what's the problem?\NYou have the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.38,0:25:23.97,Default,,0,0,0,,No, had. l spent\Nalmost the whole wad.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.13,0:25:25.55,Default,,0,0,0,,l mean, l got\Nlike 2 grand left.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.71,0:25:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,l told you, all this\Ncrap was expensive.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.63,0:25:32.55,Default,,0,0,0,,So these thieves,\Ndid they say where they\Nwould be stealing it from?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.72,0:25:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,A chemical supply place,\Nsouth of town.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.64,0:25:39.73,Default,,0,0,0,,They got guards and security\Ncameras. They got steel doors.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.89,0:25:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why these dudes\Nare charging so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.31,0:25:44.39,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.57,0:25:46.61,Default,,0,0,0,,[♪♪♪]
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.78,0:25:53.99,Default,,0,0,0,,WALT:\NHmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.16,0:25:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,[RATTLlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.66,0:26:02.75,Default,,0,0,0,,So why don't we\Njust steal it ourselves?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.13,0:26:05.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.84,0:26:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,How we gonna\Ndo that?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.26,0:26:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,With this.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.15,0:26:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what's this stuff called again?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.78,0:26:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Thermite.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.45,0:26:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,And that will cut\Nthrough a lock?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.87,0:26:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Because this is supposed\Nto be one big-ass lock.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.74,0:26:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,ln World War ll,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.45,0:26:44.45,Default,,0,0,0,,the Germans had an artillery piece--\Nlt's the biggest in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.63,0:26:46.55,Default,,0,0,0,,--called the Gustav Gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.75,0:26:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,And it weighed\Na thousand tons.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.51,0:26:53.85,Default,,0,0,0,,And the Gustav was capable\Nof firing a 7-ton shell
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.01,0:26:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,,and hitting a target,\Naccurately, 23 miles away.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.56,0:27:03.81,Default,,0,0,0,,l mean, you could drop bombs\Non it every day for a month
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.98,0:27:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,without ever disabling it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.94,0:27:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,But drop a commando,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.65,0:27:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,one man,\Nwith just a bag of this. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.03,0:27:20.03,Default,,0,0,0,,and he could melt right through\N4 inches of solid steel
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.24,0:27:22.49,Default,,0,0,0,,and destroy that gun forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.50,0:27:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Jeez.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.88,0:27:30.05,Default,,0,0,0,,[COUGHS]
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.25,0:27:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,So, yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.05,0:27:37.51,Default,,0,0,0,,l think it will cut through\Nany lock we're likely to find.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.68,0:27:42.39,Default,,0,0,0,,MAN: You'd like to return this.\NSKYLER: lt's very nice, but yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.56,0:27:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it-- lt is from\Nthis store, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.98,0:27:47.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes, it's from this store.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.86,0:27:50.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you happen to have a receipt?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.19,0:27:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,No, l don't. lt was a gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.86,0:27:54.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Aha. A gift.\NMm-hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.78,0:27:57.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Wilson, could you\Nstep over here, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.37,0:28:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Wilson, l'd like you to watch\Nthis lady while l phone the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.79,0:28:05.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.33,0:28:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma'am, this item is stolen,\Nas l'm sure you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.04,0:28:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,lt--\NCome with me, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.38,0:28:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes. l intend\Nto press charges.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.72,0:28:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Please do.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.39,0:28:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.10,0:28:28.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, l-- l've never stolen\Nanything in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.90,0:28:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,All right? l told you,\Nthat tiara was a gift--
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.11,0:28:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,A baby-shower gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.49,0:28:36.37,Default,,0,0,0,,So who gave it to you, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.61,0:28:40.11,Default,,0,0,0,,l don't think l have\Nto tell you that.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.32,0:28:42.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma'am, you don't have\Nto tell me anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.24,0:28:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You can talk to the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.24,0:28:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,And l can tell them how my\Ndaughter-in-law remembers
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.75,0:28:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,showing this particular item\Nto a tall blond woman
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.92,0:28:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,who, when her back was turned,\Nwalked right out the door with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.42,0:28:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,So there.\NOh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.34,0:28:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, then, l can talk\Nto the Channel Three News.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.47,0:29:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, l can tell them how\Nyou people, without a shred--
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.60,0:29:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Without a modicum of evidence,\Nillegally detained
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.85,0:29:11.27,Default,,0,0,0,,an innocent pregnant woman\Nin a dank storeroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.44,0:29:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my office.\Nl feel l'm being held hostage.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.44,0:29:19.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Furthermore, l'm not\Ngetting enough air back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.28,0:29:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,l don't think-- l don't\Nthink l can breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.07,0:29:24.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my-- Oh, my God. Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.12,0:29:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,l'm going into labor.\NYes, l-- Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.46,0:29:30.13,Default,,0,0,0,,[BREATHlNG HEAVlLY]
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.13,0:29:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,MARlE [ON MESSAGE]:\NHi, you've reached Marie.\NDo the beep thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.51,0:29:44.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Marie, it's Skyler.\Nl just left Zachary's.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.14,0:29:47.81,Default,,0,0,0,,l need to talk to you\Nimmediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.98,0:29:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,[PHONE BEEPS]
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.39,0:29:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,WALT:\NWhere is the guard?\NHe's supposed to be coming by.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.69,0:29:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think he already passed?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.15,0:29:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,JESSE:\NLook, l don't-- l don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.03,0:29:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. Wait, there he is.\NThere he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.99,0:30:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,WALT:\NYeah, yeah, l see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.82,0:30:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,JESSE:\NOkay, wait till he passes.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.66,0:30:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, it's clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.41,0:30:09.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.33,0:30:14.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is this?\Nlt's all they had.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.96,0:30:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you go to another store.\Nlf this is all they had,\Nyou're in the wrong place.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.13,0:30:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Just put it on.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.63,0:30:21.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Should've-- Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.35,0:30:27.23,Default,,0,0,0,,[METAL SNAPPlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.14,0:30:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.64,0:30:33.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.19,0:30:37.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.37,0:30:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,JESSE:\NOkay.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.04,0:30:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,JESSE: Get--\NWALT: What?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.37,0:30:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,JESSE: Look.\NWALT: What?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.71,0:30:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,GUARD:\NHey, Jimmy, l'm stopping...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.34,0:31:01.59,Default,,0,0,0,,WALT:\NHe's not supposed to\Ncome back. What's he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.05,0:31:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.51,0:31:06.05,Default,,0,0,0,,MAN [OVER RADlO]:\NHope everything comes out all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.22,0:31:09.51,Default,,0,0,0,,He's going to the crapper.\NOh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.68,0:31:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. You coming, man? Come on.\NWhat are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.05,0:31:47.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, there it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.76,0:31:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,,ls this gonna be loud?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.56,0:31:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll find out\Nin about 1 0 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.27,0:31:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand back.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.52,0:32:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.53,0:32:12.11,Default,,0,0,0,,[ALARM BUZZlNG AND RlNGlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.29,0:32:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.75,0:32:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,[RATTLlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.96,0:32:19.09,Default,,0,0,0,,GUARD:\NHey, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.46,0:32:21.55,Default,,0,0,0,,[♪♪♪]
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.34,0:32:25.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are the gallon jugs?\Nl don't--
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.76,0:32:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,God!\NWhat?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.30,0:32:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's just take this.\NCome on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.80,0:32:32.59,Default,,0,0,0,,What the--?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.27,0:32:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.77,0:32:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,WALT:\NWhat the hell are you\Ndoing opening the door?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.65,0:32:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,JESSE:\NHow are we\Ngonna take this thing out?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.32,0:32:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,WALT:\NCome on. Take that.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.11,0:32:47.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Lift.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.32,0:32:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,[BOTH GRUNTlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.57,0:32:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,JESSE: God.\NWALT: Jeez.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.33,0:32:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey. Somebody?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.70,0:32:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,MAN [OVER RADlO]:\NBilly, you back from\Nthe crapper yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.58,0:32:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.87,0:33:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,l'm gonna kick somebody's ass.\NThe alarm's going off. Check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.09,0:33:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Billy? Billy?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.09,0:33:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Jimmy? Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.31,0:33:19.39,Default,,0,0,0,,[ENGlNE STALLlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.19,0:33:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, man, let me try it.\NHow is it gonna be any different?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.03,0:33:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Can l just try it?\NFine, fine, go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.90,0:33:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Jesus. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.36,0:33:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.12,0:33:34.37,Default,,0,0,0,,[ENGlNE STALLlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.87,0:33:37.91,Default,,0,0,0,,[ENGlNE STARTS]
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.12,0:33:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, baby. See?\NEat it. Okay, l'm the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.54,0:33:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, okay.\Nl'm the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.25,0:33:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,[ENGlNE STOPS]
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.50,0:33:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no. No, no, no.\NThat didn't sound good.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.05,0:33:53.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.55,0:33:56.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, this thing's\Nnot going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.72,0:34:00.43,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not cooking\Nin my damn driveway,\Nl'll tell you that.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.65,0:34:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,WALT:\NGod.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.57,0:34:10.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What part of "slow it down"\Ndid you not understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.28,0:34:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking--?\Nl'm-- lt's heavy, man.\Nlt got away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.95,0:34:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,WALT:\NOkay. All right.\NNow, that's good, that's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.87,0:34:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Now just bring it up,\Nbring it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.25,0:34:23.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Easy, easy, easy. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.71,0:34:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Your real-estate agent,\Nwhen is she supposed\Nto come back?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.42,0:34:28.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.71,0:34:31.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. l don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.26,0:34:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,l'll make damn sure\Nshe doesn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.76,0:34:37.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Good call, yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.31,0:34:43.77,Default,,0,0,0,,[CELL PHONE RlNGlNG\NAND VlBRATlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.05,0:35:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,WALT:\NKeep the temperature\Nsteady at 425 degrees.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.30,0:35:18.51,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll need to run it\Ntwo more hours
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.68,0:35:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,to have enough to make\N4.5 pounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.35,0:35:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Four and a half, not 4?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.64,0:35:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Two pounds pays, two go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.19,0:35:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Four and a half pounds\Nputs us $44,000 ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.57,0:35:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Each.\NRight on, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.91,0:35:35.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Right on.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.16,0:35:38.87,Default,,0,0,0,,With the amount of methylamine\Nthat we got last night,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.03,0:35:42.07,Default,,0,0,0,,we can make\N4.5 pounds a week for. ..
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.25,0:35:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, for the foreseeable future.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.29,0:35:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,How long is, uh, that gonna be?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.50,0:35:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,l mean, in your, uh, situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.05,0:35:55.51,Default,,0,0,0,,How much cash\Ndo you need?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.76,0:35:56.97,Default,,0,0,0,,[SlGHS]
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.14,0:35:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,More.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.01,0:36:02.51,Default,,0,0,0,,[PEOPLE CHATTERlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.68,0:36:03.97,Default,,0,0,0,,[GASPS]
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.14,0:36:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone's in the yard.\NShh.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.35,0:36:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,MAN:\NYeah, this is definitely the one.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.61,0:36:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,WOMAN:\Nlt's pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.57,0:36:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,WOMAN:\NActually, l like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.40,0:36:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We could pull that out\Nand put in a closet.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.61,0:36:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a little--\NWe'll have to bring that down.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.16,0:36:23.37,Default,,0,0,0,,MAN:\Nl thought you didn't\Nlike that type of thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.54,0:36:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,WOMAN:\NOh, no. No, l don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.50,0:36:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,MAN:\NRight, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.21,0:36:29.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Shh. Shh.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.05,0:36:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Was there, by any chance,\Nscheduled for this afternoon,\Nan open house?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.93,0:36:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,l left her a message, man.\Nlt's not my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.89,0:36:43.93,Default,,0,0,0,,l don't care how you do it,\Njust keep them out of here.\NDo you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.10,0:36:45.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.\NAll right, go.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.23,0:36:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,[KEZlAH JONES'\N"BEAUTlFUL EMlLE"\NPLAYlNG OVER SPEAKERS]
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.61,0:37:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,[WOMEN CHATTERlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.58,0:37:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,WOMAN:\NAbsolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.26,0:37:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, you can't\Nduck me forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.42,0:37:18.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.88,0:37:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, l left you\Nlike 1 5 messages.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.30,0:37:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,When l went to your\Noffice, you snuck\Nout the back way.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.97,0:37:26.89,Default,,0,0,0,,l didn't sneak.\Nl was going to lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.06,0:37:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Jeez, Skyler, what are you,\Nthe paranoid police?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.27,0:37:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what, Marie?\NMarie, l have never been\Nso humiliated in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.77,0:37:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That-- Ahem.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.19,0:37:39.23,Default,,0,0,0,,[WHlSPERS]\NThat tiara.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.40,0:37:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,,They accused me,\Nat Zachary's, of shoplifting it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.62,0:37:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,[WHlSPERlNG]\NWhat were you doing at Zachary's?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.29,0:37:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,[SlGHS]
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.79,0:37:48.71,Default,,0,0,0,,l was returning it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.46,0:37:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,[lN NORMAL VOlCE]\NYou were returning it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.63,0:37:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would you return it?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.13,0:37:56.55,Default,,0,0,0,,[lN NORMAL VOlCE]\Nlt just wasn't--
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.71,0:38:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Marie, what is wrong with you?\NCan you please tell me that?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.97,0:38:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you tell me why\Nyou'd do such a thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.02,0:38:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What does that mean?\NDoes that mean you don't know?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.48,0:38:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That...means that l have\Nno idea what the hell\Nyou're even talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.07,0:38:21.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You have no idea\Nwhat l'm talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.28,0:38:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The shop--
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.78,0:38:26.91,Default,,0,0,0,,[WHlSPERlNG]\NThe shoplifting. No idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.00,0:38:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,[lN NORMAL VOlCE]\NYou're not going to\Nadmit this, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.12,0:38:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,[SCOFFS]
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.33,0:38:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,l can't really admit\Nto something
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.59,0:38:40.47,Default,,0,0,0,,when l have no knowledge\Nof what it is that l'm admitting.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.11,0:38:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,MAN:\NWould you like\Nthat gift-wrapped?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.57,0:38:59.57,Default,,0,0,0,,WOMAN:\NYes, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.73,0:39:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't forget\Nto sign in.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.40,0:39:05.07,Default,,0,0,0,,[SNlFFlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.70,0:39:09.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.\NThank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.45,0:39:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,MAN:\NYou're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.25,0:39:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at this wall here.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.47,0:39:26.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.72,0:39:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,[KNOCKlNG ON DOOR]
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.93,0:39:30.43,Default,,0,0,0,,MAN: Excuse me,\Nl'd just like to see\Nthe basement.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.60,0:39:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, it's occupied.\Nlt's not a bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.98,0:39:35.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!\Nl just want to see the basement.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.27,0:39:37.23,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the big deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.40,0:39:39.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You ain't seeing\Nthe basement, bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.36,0:39:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You got that? ls that\Nsinking in? Now, beat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.57,0:39:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,All you all,\Nhouse is not for sale.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.86,0:39:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Get the hell out!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.19,0:40:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,[SlGHS]
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.74,0:40:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahh.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.45,0:40:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.\NHey.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.37,0:40:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,So how was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.54,0:40:37.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Was it an experience?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.75,0:40:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.42,0:40:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,lt was definitely\Nan experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.34,0:40:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,[BOTH CHUCKLE]
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.47,0:40:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,[SNlFFlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.47,0:40:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that smell?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.39,0:40:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, it's.. .
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.18,0:40:56.89,Default,,0,0,0,,sacred Navajo herbs.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.06,0:40:58.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You know.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.65,0:41:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,,[GROANS]
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.32,0:41:05.03,Default,,0,0,0,,[SlGHS]
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.41,0:41:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, everything okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.83,0:41:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.45,0:41:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.41,0:41:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,[CHUCKLES]
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.75,0:41:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.00,0:41:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,[SlGHS]
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.55,0:41:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You know that tiara\Nthat Marie gave us?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.26,0:41:33.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.\NWell, she stole it. Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.18,0:41:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,l practically got arrested\Ntrying to return it at the store.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.48,0:41:39.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.85,0:41:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,l mean, she refuses to admit it.\NShe refuses to apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.07,0:41:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,l don't know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.36,0:41:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.78,0:41:56.53,Default,,0,0,0,,People sometimes\Ndo things for their families.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.71,0:42:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,People sometimes\Ndo things for their families?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.42,0:42:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,And, what,\Nthat justifies stealing?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.80,0:42:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Well.. .
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.72,0:42:12.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow. That must've been\Nsome sweat lodge.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.09,0:42:16.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you even listening\Nto the words coming\Nout of your mouth?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.81,0:42:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What would you do\Nif it were me?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.40,0:42:27.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean,\Nif it were you?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.90,0:42:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,lf it were me, what would you do?\NWould you divorce me?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.74,0:42:35.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you turn me in to the police?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.88,0:42:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't want to find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.51,0:43:00.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You want\Nsomething to eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.98,0:43:06.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, no, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.46,0:43:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this shit?\NThis is blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.67,0:43:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We used a different\Nchemical process,\Nbut it is every bit as pure.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.09,0:43:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,lt may be blue,\Nbut it's the bomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.39,0:43:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,,[SNlFFS]
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.85,0:43:44.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! Tight, tight, tight, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.23,0:43:46.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Blue, yellow, pink.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.98,0:43:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever, man. Just keep\Nbringing me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.40,0:43:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahh.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.16,0:44:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,4.6.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.33,0:44:03.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.83,0:44:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,And what'd l say, man?\NThis guy can cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.21,0:44:10.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You're all right, man.\NYou're all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.34,0:44:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna make\Na lot of money together.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.01,0:44:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Just remember\Nwho you're working for.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.68,0:44:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.47,0:44:24.47,Default,,0,0,0,,l'm just saying, they gotta know\Nthat they're working for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.02,0:44:27.19,Default,,0,0,0,,TUCO:\NLike they don't\Nalready know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.19,0:44:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you saying\Nthat they're stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.94,0:44:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,No, l'm just--\Nl'm just saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.69,0:44:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, so you're not saying\Nthat they're stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.49,0:44:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,So l don't understand.\NAre you saying that l'm stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.28,0:44:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,MAN:\NNo, come on, Tuco.\Nl'm just-- l'm just saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.41,0:44:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you're just\Nspeaking for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.41,0:44:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Like l ain't got the goddamn\Nsense to speak for myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.04,0:44:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,ls that it? ls that\Nwhat you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.55,0:44:56.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Tuco.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.22,0:45:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, why don't we\Nall just relax, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.68,0:45:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,[LAUGHlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.23,0:45:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Heisenberg says "relax."
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.90,0:45:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,[SPEAKS lN SPANlSH]
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.32,0:45:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,l'm relaxed. l'm relaxed.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.32,0:45:22.57,Default,,0,0,0,,l'm relax--
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.62,0:45:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,[TUCO GRUNTlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.51,0:45:41.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoo! Damn, man!\NLook at that! Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.09,0:45:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Whew!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.68,0:45:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That is messed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.18,0:45:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, Heisenberg. Next week.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.06,0:45:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,[LAUGHS]
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.61,0:45:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,,[GNARLS BARKLEY'S\N"WHO'S GONNA\NSAVE MY SOUL" PLAYlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.37,0:46:11.87,Default,,0,0,0,,[ENGlNE STARTS]
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.38,0:46:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,[TRUCK DRlVES OFF]
